# 6. Observation Events

Observation events represent incoming facts or signals entering the runtime.

Expected flow:

```text
External Data
    ↓
Observation
    ↓
Event
    ↓
Runtime Processing
```

Example evidence shape:

```json
{
  "trace_id": "TRACE_EXAMPLE",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "event_type": "OBSERVATION",
  "source": "NICAI",
  "contract_version": "1.0",
  "payload": {
    "observation_id": "OBS_EXAMPLE"
  }
}
```

This is an evidence-format example and is not a claim of a specific production event.

